<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Toy Story World | Toy Adventures</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #fff7d6;
    color: #222;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

header {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0057b8, #00a6ff);
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px 15px;
}

header h1 {
    font-size: 40px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

header p {
    font-size: 18px;
}

nav {
    background: #ffcf33;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 14px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
}

nav a {
    color: #17346b;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    display: inline-block;
}

nav a:hover {
    background: #ff7733;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 8px;
}

.hero {
    min-height: 450px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b5ed7, #00c6ff, #ffe45e);
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 90px 20px;
}

.hero h2 {
    font-size: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    text-shadow: 2px 3px 5px #333;
}

.hero p {
    font-size: 20px;
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: auto;
}

.btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #ff5733;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 12px 22px;
    margin: 15px 6px;
    border-radius: 25px;
    border: none;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
}

.btn:hover {
    background: #d93025;
    transform: scale(1.04);
}

section {
    padding: 50px 7%;
}

.section-title {
    text-align: center;
    color: #0749a4;
    font-size: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.about {
    background: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
}

.about p {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: auto;
}

.characters {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #ffe9a8, #ffd0dc);
}

.card-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 22px;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 15px #0002;
    text-align: center;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-7px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 22px #0003;
}

.card img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 230px;
    object-fit: cover;
}

.card h3 {
    color: #0057b8;
    padding: 10px;
}

.card p {
    padding: 0 15px 18px;
}

.movies {
    background: #dff5ff;
}

.table-container {
    overflow-x: auto;
}

table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    background: white;
    margin: 20px 0;
}

th {
    background: #0057b8;
    color: white;
}

th, td {
    border: 1px solid #bbb;
    padding: 13px;
    text-align: center;
}

tr:nth-child(even) {
    background: #fff1bc;
}

tr:hover {
    background: #d6f5ff;
}

.gallery {
    background: #e9ddff;
}

.gallery-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 15px;
}

.gallery-grid img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 210px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 4px solid white;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.gallery-grid img:hover {
    transform: scale(1.04);
}

.adventures {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #d9ffdd, #fff1ad);
}

.adventure-box {
    background: white;
    margin: 15px 0;
    padding: 20px;
    border-left: 7px solid #ff5733;
    border-radius: 10px;
}

.adventure-box h3 {
    color: #0057b8;
}

.form-section {
    background: #ffe2ed;
}

.form-box {
    background: white;
    padding: 28px;
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: 20px auto;
    border-radius: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 15px #0002;
}

label {
    display: block;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 15px;
}

input, select, textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px;
    margin-top: 6px;
    border: 1px solid #aaa;
    border-radius: 7px;
    font-size: 15px;
}

textarea {
    min-height: 110px;
    resize: vertical;
}

.google-form {
    background: white;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: auto;
}

.google-form iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 600px;
    border: none;
}

.contact {
    background: #d7f9ee;
    text-align: center;
}

footer {
    background: #12284c;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px;
}

footer a {
    color: #ffe45e;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
    header h1 {
        font-size: 29px;
    }

    .hero h2 {
        font-size: 34px;
    }

    nav a {
        padding: 7px;
        font-size: 14px;
    }

    section {
        padding: 35px 5%;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>🤠 TOY STORY WORLD 🚀</h1>
    <p>Adventure, Friendship, Imagination and Fun!</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#characters">Characters</a>
    <a href="#movies">Movies</a>
    <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
    <a href="#adventures">Adventures</a>
    <a href="#googleform">Google Form</a>
    <a href="#feedback">Feedback</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<!-- HOME SECTION -->
<section class="hero" id="home">
    <h2>To Infinity and Beyond! 🚀</h2>

    <p>
        Welcome to Toy Story World, an exciting fan-made website
        celebrating Woody, Buzz Lightyear, Jessie and their amazing
        adventures. Discover the characters, explore the movies,
        and celebrate the magic of friendship!
    </p>

    <a href="#characters" class="btn">Meet the Characters</a>
    <a href="#movies" class="btn">Explore the Movies</a>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT SECTION -->
<section class="about" id="about">
    <h2 class="section-title">🌟 About Toy Story</h2>

    <p>
        Toy Story is a beloved animated film franchise created by
        Pixar Animation Studios. The story follows a group of toys
        that come alive when humans are not around. Their exciting
        journeys explore friendship, loyalty, courage, teamwork,
        growing up and learning to accept change.
    </p>

    <p>
        Woody is a loyal cowboy toy, while Buzz Lightyear is a space
        ranger who learns what friendship truly means. Together with
        their friends, they discover that every adventure is better
        when they work together.
    </p>

    <br>

    <h3>Why Fans Love Toy Story ❤️</h3>

    <p>
        Memorable characters • Funny adventures • Beautiful animation
        • Emotional stories • Friendship • Imagination
    </p>
</section>

<!-- CHARACTER SECTION -->
<section class="characters" id="characters">
    <h2 class="section-title">🧸 Meet the Characters</h2>

    <div class="card-container">

        <div class="card">
            <img
              src="https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/pp_woody_herobanner_mobile_19736_3f7a1f7d.jpeg"
              alt="Woody cowboy toy"
              loading="lazy">
            <h3>🤠 Woody</h3>
            <p>A brave cowboy who cares deeply about his friends
            and always tries to do the right thing.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img
              src="https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/pp_buzzlightyear_herobanner_mobile_19736_0b8f3d7e.jpeg"
              alt="Buzz Lightyear space ranger"
              loading="lazy">
            <h3>🚀 Buzz Lightyear</h3>
            <p>A space ranger who discovers the importance of
            teamwork, loyalty and believing in himself.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img
              src="https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/pp_jessie_herobanner_mobile_19736_9eab9b15.jpeg"
              alt="Jessie the cowgirl"
              loading="lazy">
            <h3>🤠 Jessie</h3>
            <p>An energetic cowgirl who brings courage,
            excitement and enthusiasm to every adventure.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img
              src="https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/pp_rex_herobanner_mobile_19736_3c1f6bb9.jpeg"
              alt="Rex the dinosaur toy"
              loading="lazy">
            <h3>🦖 Rex</h3>
            <p>A friendly dinosaur who may be nervous sometimes
            but always wants to help his friends.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img
              src="https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/pp_lotso_herobanner_mobile_19736_3b3f4bb2.jpeg"
              alt="Lotso bear"
              loading="lazy">
            <h3>🧸 Lotso</h3>
            <p>A strawberry-scented pink bear whose complicated
            story plays an important role in Toy Story 3.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img
              src="https://lumiere-a.akamaihd.net/v1/images/pp_forky_herobanner_mobile_19736_7f9d0f21.jpeg"
              alt="Forky character"
              loading="lazy">
            <h3>🍴 Forky</h3>
            <p>A handmade craft who begins a surprising journey
            of self-discovery in Toy Story 4.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<!-- MOVIES TABLE -->
<section class="movies" id="movies">
    <h2 class="section-title">🎬 Toy Story Movie Collection</h2>

    <p>
        Explore the main Toy Story films and learn about the
        adventures that make each story special.
    </p>

    <div class="table-container">
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>No.</th>
                    <th>Movie</th>
                    <th>Release Year</th>
                    <th>Main Theme</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>

            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>1</td>
                    <td>Toy Story</td>
                    <td>1995</td>
                    <td>Friendship and jealousy</td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                    <td>2</td>
                    <td>Toy Story 2</td>
                    <td>1999</td>
                    <td>Identity and belonging</td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                    <td>3</td>
                    <td>Toy Story 3</td>
                    <td>2010</td>
                    <td>Growing up and letting go</td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                    <td>4</td>
                    <td>Toy Story 4</td>
                    <td>2019</td>
                    <td>Purpose and new beginnings</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <h3>Movie Highlights</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>The original friendship between Woody and Buzz.</li>
        <li>The discovery of Woody's past in Toy Story 2.</li>
        <li>The emotional farewell in Toy Story 3.</li>
        <li>Forky's journey and Woody's choices in Toy Story 4.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<!-- GALLERY -->
<section class="gallery" id="gallery">
    <h2 class="section-title">📸 Toy Story Image Gallery</h2>

    <p style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:25px;">
        Explore a collection of images featuring memorable
        characters and colourful animated adventures.
    </p>

    <div class="gallery-grid">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531058020387-3be344556be6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80"
          alt="Colourful entertainment event"
          loading="lazy">

        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558060370-d644479cb6f7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80"
          alt="Colourful toy figures"
          loading="lazy">

        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560961911-ba7ef651a56c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80"
          alt="Colourful toy collection"
          loading="lazy">

        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599623560574-39d485900c95?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80"
          alt="Toy collection"
          loading="lazy">

        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566576912321-d58ddd7a6088?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80"
          alt="Toys and playtime"
          loading="lazy">

        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515488042361-ee00e0ddd4e4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80"
          alt="Colourful children's toys"
          loading="lazy">
    </div>

    <p style="text-align:center; margin-top:20px;">
        Note: Gallery images are illustrative and may not depict
        actual Toy Story characters. Internet access is required
        to load the remote images.
    </p>
</section>

<!-- ADVENTURES -->
<section class="adventures" id="adventures">
    <h2 class="section-title">🌈 Adventures and Fun Facts</h2>

    <div class="adventure-box">
        <h3>🚀 Space Ranger Adventure</h3>
        <p>
            Imagine exploring distant planets, solving mysteries
            and helping friends just like a space ranger.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="adventure-box">
        <h3>🤠 Cowboy Adventure</h3>
        <p>
            Join Woody on an imaginary Wild West adventure filled
            with teamwork, courage and exciting discoveries.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="adventure-box">
        <h3>🤝 Friendship Challenge</h3>
        <p>
            Help a friend, share your toys, listen carefully
            and remember that everyone deserves kindness.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="adventure-box">
        <h3>💡 Lessons from Toy Story</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Friendship is more important than competition.</li>
            <li>Be brave when facing something new.</li>
            <li>Accept people for who they are.</li>
            <li>Teamwork can solve difficult problems.</li>
            <li>Change can lead to exciting opportunities.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- GOOGLE FORM -->
<section class="form-section" id="googleform">
    <h2 class="section-title">📝 Google Form — Fan Registration</h2>

    <div class="google-form">
        <h3>Join Toy Story World!</h3>

        <p>
            Embed your own Google Form below to collect fan
            registrations, favourite characters and suggestions.
        </p>

        <br>

        <p>
            <strong>Setup instructions:</strong>
            Create a form in Google Forms, select
            <em>Send → Embed HTML (&lt;/&gt;)</em>, copy the
            iframe embed code and replace the placeholder below
            with that code.
        </p>

        <div style="margin-top:25px; padding:20px;
                    background:#fff1bc; border-radius:10px;">
            <p>
                Your Google Form will appear here after you add
                its embed code.
            </p>
            <p>
                <a
                  class="btn"
                  href="https://forms.google.com/"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer">
                  Create a Google Form
                </a>
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- REPLACE THIS COMMENT WITH YOUR GOOGLE FORM IFRAME -->
        <!-- Example:
        <iframe
          src="YOUR_GOOGLE_FORM_EMBED_URL"
          width="100%"
          height="600"
          frameborder="0"
          marginheight="0"
          marginwidth="0">
          Loading…
        </iframe>
        -->
    </div>
</section>

<!-- FEEDBACK FORM -->
<section class="form-section" id="feedback">
    <h2 class="section-title">⭐ Fan Feedback Form</h2>

    <div class="form-box">
        <form action="#" method="get"
              onsubmit="alert('Thank you for visiting Toy Story World! This demo form does not save responses.'); return false;">

            <label for="name">Your Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name"
                   placeholder="Enter your name" required>

            <label for="email">Email Address</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email"
                   placeholder="Enter your email" required>

            <label for="character">Favourite Character</label>
            <select id="character" name="character" required>
                <option value="">Choose a character</option>
                <option>Woody</option>
                <option>Buzz Lightyear</option>
                <option>Jessie</option>
                <option>Rex</option>
                <option>Lotso</option>
                <option>Forky</option>
            </select>

            <label for="rating">Rate Our Website</label>
            <select id="rating" name="rating" required>
                <option value="">Select your rating</option>
                <option>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Excellent</option>
                <option>⭐⭐⭐⭐ Very Good</option>
                <option>⭐⭐⭐ Good</option>
                <option>⭐⭐ Average</option>
                <option>⭐ Needs Improvement</option>
            </select>

            <label for="message">Your Suggestions</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message"
                      placeholder="Tell us what you think..."></textarea>

            <button class="btn" type="submit">
                Submit Feedback
            </button>

            <button class="btn" type="reset">
                Clear Form
            </button>

        </form>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- CONTACT -->
<section class="contact" id="contact">
    <h2 class="section-title">📞 Contact and Information</h2>

    <p><strong>Website:</strong> Toy Story World</p>
    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Fan-made educational website</p>
    <p><strong>Topics:</strong> Characters, movies, adventures and friendship</p>

    <p>
        For official Toy Story information, visit
        <a href="https://www.pixar.com/"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
           Pixar
        </a>
        or
        <a href="https://www.disney.com/"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
           Disney
        </a>.
    </p>

    <br>

    <a href="#home" class="btn">⬆️ Back to Top</a>
</section>

<footer>
    <h3>🤠 Toy Story World 🚀</h3>

    <p>Celebrating imagination, friendship and adventure.</p>

    <p>
        This is an unofficial fan-made website.
        Toy Story and its characters belong to their respective
        copyright and trademark owners.
    </p>

    <p>&copy; 2026 Toy Story World — Fan Project</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
        <